2025</span></span></p><h1 class="post__title" data-v-e174a07f>Operations Fleet Lease Management use case</h1></header><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/51a1d737-b024-4d66-8fec-e2e8754fe946_Evri%2bbranded%2btrucks%2bwide00bd.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/51a1d737-b024-4d66-8fec-e2e8754fe946_Evri+branded+trucks+wide.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C6000%2C4500&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/51a1d737-b024-4d66-8fec-e2e8754fe946_Evri+branded+trucks+wide.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C6000%2C4500&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/51a1d737-b024-4d66-8fec-e2e8754fe946_Evri+branded+trucks+wide.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C6000%2C4500&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="960" height="720" class="post__featured-image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e174a07f><section class="post__content" data-v-e174a07f><div data-v-e174a07f><!--[--><section id="evri-leads-the-way-in-logistics-with-ai-driven-automation-using-power-platform-|-microsoft-customer-stories---case-study-originally-published-on-the-microsoft-website." class="section-wrapper rich-text" index="0" data-v-92714c58 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><a href="https://www.microsoft.com/en/customers/story/25358-evri-microsoft-power-platform" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri leads the way in logistics with AI-driven automation using Power Platform | Microsoft Customer Stories<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> - Case study originally published on the Microsoft website.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section><section id="evri-sought-an-efficient-method-to-automate-business-processes-through-low-code-development-and-selected-power-platform-as-the-foundation-for-automation." class="section-wrapper rich-text" index="1" data-v-92714c58 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri sought an efficient method to automate business processes through low code development and selected Power Platform as the foundation for automation.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->As automation initiatives expanded, the team increasingly utilised the Power Platform toolset in collaboration with Robiquity, Evri’s AI &amp; Automation strategic partner. One example is a solution implemented to manage the company’s fleet of over 6,000 vehicles. Previously, fleet tracking relied on a complex Excel spreadsheet that was prone to manual errors and update delays, particularly with recent fleet growth and the DHL ecommerce merger. Currently, the fleet is managed via an integrated Power Platform solution.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The project moved from idea to launch in under 12 weeks with a small core team. The app streamlines user tasks and integrates with the DVLA to enable instant verification of fleet details. Collaboration with the Fleet team contributed to the project’s successful delivery, and positive feedback has been received regarding the user’s experience of the app. The central benefit is the establishment of a single source of truth for all fleet data, supporting operational focus and improving customer experiences.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->There are plans to further develop the app by incorporating additional AI capabilities intended to provide further benefits for the business and those interested in fleet information. Agentic AI is identified as the next big step for this use case, along with several other potential applications across Evri.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section><section id="-" class="section-wrapper rich-text" index="2" data-v-92714c58 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->-<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section><section id="ai-and-automation" data-slice="FeatureBanner" class="feature-banner" index="3" data-v-054940bd><div class="feature-banner__container" data-v-054940bd><div class="feature-banner__content" data-v-054940bd><!----><h2 class="feature-banner__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-054940bd>AI and automation</h2><div class="feature-banner__text" data-v-054940bd><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We&#39;re safely implementing AI to deliver better for our people, customers, clients and couriers.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Check out the latest news and updates about exciting projects we&#39;ve been working on and more.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-3 e-button--icon-right e-button--link feature-banner__button" data-gtm-track="button-Find out more" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/ai-and-automation" data-v-054940bd style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Find out more<!--]--></span></a></div><div class="feature-banner__image" data-v-054940bd><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aGvBzEMqNJQqHmbq_AIhumancollaboration93e3.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aGvBzEMqNJQqHmbq_AIhumancollaboration.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=1%2C0%2C4996%2C3332&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aGvBzEMqNJQqHmbq_AIhumancollaboration.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=1%2C0%2C4996%2C3332&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aGvBzEMqNJQqHmbq_AIhumancollaboration.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=1%2C0%2C4996%2C3332&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A human and robot index finger are shown to meet in the middle of the photo" width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-054940bd></div><!----></div></section><section id="rich_text" class="section-wrapper rich-text" index="4" data-v-92714c58 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->– End –<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> is one of the UK’s dedicated parcel delivery company, delivering more than 800 million parcels a year. The company has a mission to be the most convenient way to send, receive and return parcels, without costing the earth. Evri works with most of Europe’s top retailers, marketplaces and pre-loved sites. The roots of Evri can be traced back to Yorkshire in 1974 but the business has grown over the decades and now has a team of 8,000+ employees, 25,000+ couriers, 10,000+ out of home locations and a growing network of state-of-the-art hubs and depots. Evri has more than 3 million independent 5-star Trustpilot reviews, on-time delivery rates which surpass 99%, an average courier rating of 4.7/5, and a commitment to provide an answer for everyone following a significant investment in customer experience.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--